  "title": "Street Child United Announces hashtag # IAmSomebody Tour with Bank of America",
  "summary": "Street Child United today announced its #IAmSomebody Tour, which kicked off in Tacoma, Washington, with stops also planned in Miami, Toronto, New York and Washington, D.C. Street Child United (SCU) is a youth-led global movement using the power of sport to transform how the world sees and treats street-connected young people. The tour will bring SCU Young Leaders from the Street Child World Cup to communities and decision-makers across North America during the FIFA World Cup 2026™",
